{"version":2,"exportedAt":1776917581950,"story":{"title":"Ping's Piano Song","userPrompt":"Ping armadillo that loved to play the piano","authorStyleId":"mem-fox","readingLevel":"early","illustrationStyleId":"soft_watercolor","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Ping was a small armadillo. He loved to play. He lived in a warm, green land. But Ping loved music the best! He had a big dream.","illustrationPrompt":"A small, happy armadillo named Ping sits in a lush green meadow. He has big, hopeful eyes. A glimpse of a piano is seen in the distance. Colors: Bright greens, blues, yellows. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1776896664919,"durationMs":10304,"retries":0,"promptLength":674,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small Light tan scales with darker brown bands. Pinkish underbelly. armadillo, big-expressive bright hazel eyes with dreamy/thoughtful expression, with Small blue bow tie, Slightly oversized ears, A small, heart-shaped marking on his nose, One slightly crooked scale on his back, Always has a joyful expression, chubby build. Ping the armadillo standing in a warm, green meadow, looking thoughtful and perhaps a bit dreamy. in Warm, green meadow. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"One day, Ping saw a light. It came from a dusty old shed. He crept inside, slow and low. What could this bright light be?","illustrationPrompt":"Ping cautiously peeks into a slightly dilapidated wooden shed. Sunlight streams through cracks in the walls. His expression is curious and a little nervous. Colors: Warm browns, soft yellows, greens. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1776896683394,"durationMs":6978,"retries":0,"promptLength":667,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small Light tan scales with darker brown bands. Pinkish underbelly. armadillo, big-expressive bright hazel eyes with curious/cautious expression, with Small blue bow tie, Slightly oversized ears, A small, heart-shaped marking on his nose, One slightly crooked scale on his back, Always has a joyful expression, chubby build. Ping cautiously approaching a weathered shed, a bright light emanating from within. in Outside the weathered shed. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"Inside was a piano! It was old and worn. But Ping knew what to do. He smiled. It was time to play. What a great day!","illustrationPrompt":"Ping stands in awe before an old, slightly dusty piano inside the shed. His face is full of joy and excitement. Colors: Warm browns, creams, and a pop of color from the piano keys. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1776896771559,"durationMs":22359,"retries":0,"promptLength":648,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small Light tan scales with darker brown bands. Pinkish underbelly. armadillo, big-expressive bright hazel eyes with happy/excited expression, with Small blue bow tie, Slightly oversized ears, A small, heart-shaped marking on his nose, One slightly crooked scale on his back, Always has a joyful expression, chubby build. Ping inside the shed, smiling at an old, worn piano. in Inside the weathered shed, near the piano. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"Ping sat down and pressed a key. A loud sound filled the shed. It was not very good at all. But Ping did not give up. No way!","illustrationPrompt":"Ping sits at the piano, pressing a key with his paw. His face shows a mix of surprise and determination as a discordant note rings out. Colors: Bright and playful, with emphasis on the sound waves emanating from the piano. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1776897118464,"durationMs":21790,"retries":0,"promptLength":907,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small Light tan scales with darker brown bands. Pinkish underbelly. armadillo, big-expressive bright hazel eyes with focused/determined expression, with Small blue bow tie, Slightly oversized ears, A small, heart-shaped marking on his nose, One slightly crooked scale on his back, Always has a joyful expression, chubby build. Ping sitting at the piano, pressing a key with a concentrated expression. A sound wave might be visible. in Inside the weathered shed, at the piano. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition] [variation 4, unique composition] [variation 5, unique composition] [variation 6, unique composition] [variation 6, unique composition] [variation 6, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"He tried again, and then again. Each time, a funny sound. Then, a tune! A happy little song. Ping felt so very glad.","illustrationPrompt":"Ping is concentrating hard, his brow furrowed slightly as he plays the piano. A small, simple melody is visualized as colorful notes floating above the piano. Colors: Soft pastels, warm yellows, light blues. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1776897144403,"durationMs":17979,"retries":0,"promptLength":681,"